OL,3,GNEWSAParents 'scared' to take their
OL,4,Akids to football
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnti-social behaviour including fires
OL,7,Fbeing set and eggs thrown at cars has
OL,8,Fled to parents being scared to take
OL,9,Ftheir children to training sessions,
OL,10,Fthe chairman of a grassroots football
OL,11,Fclub has said.
OL,13,FBlakelaw FC's Gavin Campbell said
OL,14,Fyouths had been causing trouble near
OL,15,Fthe Newcastle club for a couple of
OL,16,Fmonths and complained that it was
OL,17,Fhaving a "big impact" on the community.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
