OL,3,GNEWSAParents 'scared' to take their
OL,4,Akids to football
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK councillor for Blakelaw and
OL,7,FCowgate Rachel Davison said her party
OL,8,Fhad called for an emergency full
OL,9,Fcouncil meeting, saying issues were
OL,10,Fhappening "year in and year out and
OL,11,Fnothing's been put in place".
OL,13,FLiberal Democrat-led Newcastle Council
OL,14,Fsaid it had held meetings, put on
OL,15,Fpatrols and installed CCTV.
